# Curated dependency list for the GrandTour JEPA-WM (jepa-wms) pipeline.
# Installed into a python 3.10 venv by setup.sh (uv).
# Notes:
#  - torch/torchvision resolve to the latest cu130 PyPI build for py3.10.
#  - decord is intentionally absent: no Linux wheels exist and the GrandTour
#    data path does not need it (imports are patched to be lazy).
#  - torchcodec is only used by the metaworld loader (unused here).
#  - Simulation-only deps of jepa-wms (mujoco/metaworld/d4rl/robocasa...) are
#    not needed for the real-robot GrandTour recipe.

torch
torchvision
tensordict
torchrl
numpy
pandas
h5py
einops
scipy
scikit-image
pillow
timm
tqdm
termcolor
matplotlib
seaborn
plotly
hydra-core
omegaconf
ruamel.yaml
pyyaml
zarr
torchmetrics
wandb
submitit
huggingface_hub
datasets
opencv-python
lpips
imageio
imageio-ffmpeg
moviepy
mediapy
gym==0.23.1
gymnasium
pygame
pymunk==6.8.0
shapely
nevergrad
